{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582620/extras/cf44baff64862091d19a2e0612be3152.avif?t=1749666396\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582620/extras_big/cf44baff64862091d19a2e0612be3152.avif?t=1749666396 width=800 height=267 /></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your way through intense 2D and 3D environments in this adrenaline-fueled shoot 'em up! When a ruthless alien force invades the solar system, only one warrior stands between them and total annihilation. Armed with unlimited firepower and a growing arsenal of devastating upgrades, you\u2019ll battle through relentless enemy hordes and face off against massive, screen-filling bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across dynamic worlds, unlock powerful abilities, and turn the tide of war in this fast-paced arcade shooter. The fate of the solar system is in your hands \u2014 suit up, power up, and fight back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582620/extras/2d87a1c6b0b224404904e56af5b7b935.poster.avif?t=1749666396\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582620/extras/2d87a1c6b0b224404904e56af5b7b935.webm?t=1749666396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582620/extras/2d87a1c6b0b224404904e56af5b7b935.mp4?t=1749666396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582620?t=1749666396","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582620?t=1749666396","capsule_image":"https: